# AutoUGC Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values

# Required: API key for accessing the API (prevents unauthorized access)
API_KEY=your-secret-api-key-here

# Required: OpenRouter API key for vision and text models
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# Required: Fal.ai API key for video generation
FAL_KEY=your-fal-key-here

# Optional: Anthropic API key (legacy, not currently used)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# =============================================================================
# LangSmith Observability (Optional - CURRENTLY DISABLED)
# =============================================================================
# LangSmith tracing is temporarily disabled due to 25MB payload limit.
# Pipeline state includes large base64 images (~47MB) which exceed LangSmith's limit.
#
# To enable LangSmith tracing, uncomment these lines:
# LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2=true
# LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=lsv2_...
# LANGCHAIN_PROJECT=autougc-pipeline
#
# Note: You'll need to implement custom filtering to exclude image data from traces.
# See src/pipeline/state.py:_serialize_for_langsmith() for the filtering logic.
